{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE5L1dlbGNvbWUlMjB0byUyME1hcndlbiUyMCUyODIwMTklMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Welcome to Marwen","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/dOULsxYQFsOR0cEBBB20xnjJkPD.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q9hnJ9SzwcF30seRtXEzLd5l1gw.jpg","description":"When a devastating attack shatters Mark Hogancamp and wipes away all memories, no one expected recovery. Putting together pieces from his old and new life, Mark meticulously creates a wondrous town named Marwen where he can heal and be heroic. As he builds an astonishing art installation — a testament to the most powerful women he knows — through his fantasy world, he draws strength to triumph in the real one.","releaseInfo":"2019","genres":["Drama","Animation","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.5","runtime":"116 min","cast":["Steve Carell","Leslie Mann","Merritt Wever","Janelle Monáe","Diane Kruger","Falk Hentschel","Eiza González","Gwendoline Christie"],"director":["Robert Zemeckis"],"released":"2018-12-21T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"You can't put this hero in a box.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Steve Carell","character":"Mark Hogancamp","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sSxw69G0znJuettMYGDCAXfSwSY.jpg"},{"name":"Leslie Mann","character":"Nicol","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/x3OS9RL3qsv50kzRtpR2OhbuTkr.jpg"},{"name":"Merritt Wever","character":"Roberta","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ldd1WntzQ72DVuNLoko8yMFHH7j.jpg"},{"name":"Janelle Monáe","character":"GI Julie","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/eTYG6eBH1LzLWcdQJaH72Wzxemm.jpg"},{"name":"Diane Kruger","character":"Deja Thoris","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/o5gVowcjVw4ThYi0L3883Y4X7kH.jpg"},{"name":"Falk Hentschel","character":"Captain Topf / Louis","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jM2dbh9AhtahccUH8we9LYYrj6c.jpg"},{"name":"Eiza González","character":"Caralala","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/v8CnaoJqdPwkQhJeGwgJDnESO